{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Graph-of-Thoughts (GoT) 思维图\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请解释 Graph-of-Thoughts (GoT) 的概念、核心机制，与 ToT 的对比，以及它在复杂推理任务中的优势。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心概念</strong>：<br>\nGraph-of-Thoughts (GoT) 是在 ToT 基础上的进一步扩展。ToT 使用树状结构，每个节点只有一个父节点，分支之间无法合并；而 GoT 使用图结构，允许思维节点之间存在任意的连接关系——包括聚合（多个节点合并为一个）、细化（对已有节点进行改进）、以及生成新节点。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">GoT 的核心思想是：<strong>复杂问题的推理往往不是树状的层级分解，而是网状的知识关联</strong>——不同的推理路径可能最终汇聚到同一个结论，或者需要从多个角度综合信息。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心机制（图操作）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>生成（Generation）</strong>：创建新的思维节点</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>聚合（Aggregation）</strong>：将多个思维节点合并为一个（如从不同角度综合信息）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>细化（Refinement）</strong>：对已有节点进行改进和完善</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>边连接（Edge Connection）</strong>：建立节点之间的依赖或关联关系</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>GoT 的形式化表示</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">顶点（Vertex）：每个思维单元（一个想法、一个推理步骤、一个结论）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">边（Edge）：思维之间的依赖、支持、反对等关系</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">图操作：对图结构的变换（聚合、分解、细化）</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>与 ToT 的对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ToT</th>\n<th>GoT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>树（层级、有向、无环）</td>\n<td>图（任意连接、可能有环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支合并</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持聚合操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回溯</td>\n<td>回到父节点</td>\n<td>可跳转到任意相关节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示能力</td>\n<td>适合分解问题</td>\n<td>适合综合多源信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索算法</td>\n<td>BFS/DFS</td>\n<td>图遍历算法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">需要综合多个信息源的分析任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">需要迭代改进的写作和编辑任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">存在相互依赖的复杂决策</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">需要多轮头脑风暴的创意任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">需要评估多种方案优劣的比较任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示意</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Set<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> List\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> networkx <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> nx\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">GraphOfThoughts</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> nx<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>DiGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 有向图</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>node_counter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add_thought</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> parent_ids<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"添加思维节点\"\"\"</span>\n        node_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>node_counter\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> score<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> parent_ids<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pid <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> parent_ids<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pid<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>node_counter <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> node_id\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">aggregate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node_ids<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> aggregation_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"聚合多个节点\"\"\"</span>\n        contents <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nodes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>nid<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> nid <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> node_ids<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        combined <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"- </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>c<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> c <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> contents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>aggregation_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>combined<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\\n综合以上信息：\"</span></span>\n        aggregated <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        new_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>aggregated<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> nid <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> node_ids<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>nid<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> new_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> relation<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"aggregated_to\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> new_id\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">refine</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> refinement_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"细化已有节点\"\"\"</span>\n        original <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nodes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>node_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>refinement_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\\n原始内容: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>original<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\\n改进版本:\"</span></span>\n        refined <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>refined<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> parent_ids<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>node_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">search_optimal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> start_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> goal_check<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">callable</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"在图上搜索最优路径\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 使用启发式搜索（如 A*）</span>\n        visited <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        queue <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>start_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>start_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># (node, path, score)</span>\n        best_path <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n        best_score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'-inf'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> queue<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> queue<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>pop<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> goal_check<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nodes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> best_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    best_score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> score\n                    best_path <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> path\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> node <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> visited<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                visited<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> neighbor <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>successors<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> neighbor <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> visited<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                        new_score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>nodes<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>neighbor<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"score\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n                        queue<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>neighbor<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> path <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>neighbor<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> new_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> best_path\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：GoT 中的环怎么处理？答：GoT 可以有环（如 A → B → C → A），但搜索时需要环检测避免无限循环，可以通过记录已访问节点集合来处理。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：GoT 和知识图谱有什么关系？答：GoT 关注的是动态推理过程中的思维组织，知识图谱是静态的事实存储。GoT 可以在推理中利用知识图谱的信息。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：GoT 的图操作如何自动学习？答：可以训练一个\"图操作策略\"模型，学习在什么时候执行什么图操作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：GoT 一定比 ToT 好。实际上 GoT 的复杂度更高，很多任务用 ToT 已经足够。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：忽视图的维护成本。GoT 需要额外的图存储和遍历开销。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：将 GoT 和知识图谱混淆。两者虽然都使用图结构，但目的和动态性不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}